        "role": "assistant",
        "parts": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Hello! I am **DocuMind**, your intelligent document assistant. \n\nHere is what I can do for you:\n\n* **Document Question & Answering**: I can read and analyze your uploaded documents to provide accurate, factual answers to your questions.\n* **Multilingual Capabilities**: You can ask questions in any language (such as Telugu, Hindi, Spanish, or English), and I will respond in that same language—even if your source documents are written in English.\n* **Precise Citations**: I cite the exact parts of your documents (e.g., `[1]`, `[2]`) that support each answer so you can easily verify the facts.\n* **Summarization & Key Insights**: I can summarize long reports, extract key points, compare sections, or explain complex concepts simply.\n\nFeel free to ask a question or upload a document to get started!"
          }
        ],
        "metadata": {
          "sources": []
        }
